tra item 0 builds up at about 9 units per day until it expires after 8 days. Spoilage plus holding costs roughly 60 per day. Fewer shortages save only about 20–25 per day, so this plan loses to candidate 0.\n- Among the daily plans:\n  - Candidate 3 overbuys at about 1.3× / 1.16×.\n  - Candidate 4 is the most balanced at about 1.12× / 1.08×.\n  - Candidate 2 is about 1.05× / 1.0×.\n  - Candidate 5 buys at or below expected demand, so it runs short.\n  - Candidate 6 is at about 1.2× for item 0 but underbuys item 1 at about 0.8×.\n  All of them pay roughly 660 more in order fees than the every-2-days plans.\n\n**Shortages every plan shares:** item 1 runs short on days 1–3 and item 0 on day 1. With delivery times of 4 and 2 days, no plan can avoid these, so they don't change the ranking.\n\nMy conclusion: candidate 0 is the most likely best. Candidates 7 and 1 are the main alternatives, followed by the most balanced daily plan, candidate 4."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4383, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2305, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4383}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T21:41:52.884Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVMwAwaTL6yary669R2T"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_018abse3tzVoaCuF8qsGsQEq", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVMwBBDCxen9HjDa7aXm", "type": "message